            </p>
            <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9rem; display: grid; gap: 4px;">
              <li>• Hiba Dkhil</li>
              <li>• Seif Meddeb</li>
              <li>• Raghed Selmi</li>
              <li>• Fatma Mdaghi</li>
              <li>• Islem Medfai</li>
              <li>• Nour Mourali</li>
            </ul>
            <div style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 6px;">For support or inquiries:</div>
